{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_document", "label": "Agriculture Is Life: Daily Updates, 26-29 October 2026", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_r0_r9_reliability_programme", "label": "R0-R9 reliability programme", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Some reliability packages span 26-27 October. The entries distinguish the start of that work from the documented completion checkpoint rather than assigning unsupported exact completion dates. ## Daily summary"}, {"id": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_internal_invoice_only_scope", "label": "Internal invoice-only scope", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L122", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 7. Agreed the internal invoice-only scope - Confirmed that customers do not log into this system. - Set final invoice creation/printing as the end of the normal workflow."}, {"id": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_hosted_database_upgrade", "label": "Hosted database upgrade", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L161", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### 1. Upgraded the configured hosted database - Upgraded from migration `20261025_0015` to `20261027_0024`. - Applied nine migrations covering substitutions, precision, revisions, request results, source integrity, indexes, exceptions and Excel templates."}, {"id": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_data_preservation_backup", "label": "Data preservation backup", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L174", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "- 41,151 rows across 25 pre-existing application tables. - Schema/data snapshot and checksums. - Matching migration source. - All three referenced original source files and their checksum inventory."}, {"id": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_unapproved_volume_research", "label": "Unapproved volume research", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L191", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The resulting status was 302 products with numeric volumes and 516 without numeric volumes. The research report recorded zero operator-approved volumes; these remained estimates needing suitable local verification. **Benefit:** Packing preparation gained better evidence without presenting estimates as exact physical measurements."}, {"id": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_temperature_classification_gaps", "label": "Temperature classification gaps", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L242", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "- Confirmed the documented matches for 349 of 818 catalogue products. - Recorded 332 matched Cold/Foam products and 17 matched Normal/Cardboard products. - Left the other 469 products requiring review instead of accepting unsupported defaults."}, {"id": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_modern_today_dashboard", "label": "Modern Today dashboard", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L298", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### Session 8: Modernized Today - Added subtle colours for the different workflow stages. - Improved icon treatments, count badges, borders and card surfaces."}, {"id": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_release_sign_off_gates", "label": "Release sign-off gates", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L371", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "### Still required before final production sign-off - The matching complete application release/deployment. - Remaining actual database concurrency and hosted operating checks."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_document", "target": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_r0_r9_reliability_programme", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_document", "target": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_internal_invoice_only_scope", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L122", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_document", "target": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_hosted_database_upgrade", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L161", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_document", "target": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_data_preservation_backup", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/DAY_BY_DAY_WORK_LOG_2026-10-29.md", "source_location": "L174", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_document", "target": "docs_day_by_day_work_log_2026_10_29_unapproved_volume_research", "relation": "